Package: homunculus
Title: Categorical Homologation Engine
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Automates the homologation (standardisation and matching) of
    categorical variables across datasets via a dictionary-first /
    ML-fallback pipeline. Writes resolved categorical relationships to
    PostgreSQL for downstream ETL.
